k":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T20:53:25-08:00","id":1027410,"title":"","content":"Each game has gotten a sub with their X20 game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T14:37:17-08:00","id":1027851,"title":"","content":"It would still be great if the boards were a little better organized. I think it'd be proactive to do it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">R<i>emember, remember, the Fifth of November, the Gunpowder Treason and Plot. I know of no reason why the Gunpowder Treason should ever be forgot.</i>&quot;<br /> <br /> -V for Vendetta</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/997-japheth","name":"Japheth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar997_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"122"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T21:54:27-08:00","id":1028027,"title":"","content":"The stated policy is that a WoD gameline gets a board one its X20 edition becomes a thing, and not before. That said, I'm a big fan of changing \u201cX20\u201d into \u201cCommemorative Edition\u201d or \u201cOmnibus Edition\u201d or anything else that decouples it from a specific period of time, so that they can get to work updating Hunter, Mummy, and Demon right away instead of waiting two years, four years, and five years, respectively. <br /> <br /> (Or, assuming Onyx Path doesn't increase its turnaround time, they should still get to work on them right away; the X20 monikers just might be accurate then. But I prefer to believe that OP will be picking up the pace soon.)<br /> <br /> Either way, I don't see a DtF board until at least 2018; and that's assuming OP immediately ditches the X20 plan and starts doubling up on production the way they've been doing with their ChroD gamelines. If they actually stick to the X20 schedule, we've got another five years to wait.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-07T01:20:27-08:00","id":1028065,"title":"","content":"They wouldn't actually have to wait to update Mummy, as it had its first edition in 1992. In fact, if they did a rush job they could declare it a 25th Anniversary edition and release it this year!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5307-loomer","name":"loomer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5307_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-13T04:19:30-08:00","id":1048167,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1027383-demon-the-fallen-board?p=1028027#post1028027\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The stated policy is that a WoD gameline gets a board one its X20 edition becomes a thing, and not before. That said, I'm a big fan of changing \u201cX20\u201d into \u201cCommemorative Edition\u201d or \u201cOmnibus Edition\u201d or anything else that decouples it from a specific period of time, so that they can get to work updating Hunter, Mummy, and Demon right away instead of waiting two years, four years, and five years, respectively.</div> </div> </div> </div>How about World of Darkness Viginti, then? Also, I believe that Demon could be made to fit into a single book of exactly 666 pages long:<br /> <br /> &gt;Book 1: Elohim<br /> Chapter 1: A World of Darkness (lore stuff)<br /> Chapter 2: Houses of Darkness (the seven Houses and five Factions)<br /> &gt;Book 2: Sebettu<br /> Chapter 3: Characters (character creation)<br /> Chapter 4: Lores &amp; Forms (the various powers of the Fallen, as well as the rules for DIY Apocalyptic Forms)<br /> Chapter 5: Rules (how 2 WoD)<br /> Chapter 6: Dramatic Systems (how 2 WoD 2: WoD Harder)<br /> Chapter 7: Relics &amp; Rituals (rules for relics and how to make them as well as rituals and how to perform them)<br /> &gt;Book 3: Earthbound<br /> Chapter 8: Storytelling (for the ST)<br /> Chapter 9: Pacts &amp; Thralls (how to make Thralls, how to interact with them and how Pacts work)<br /> Chapter 10: Antagonists (enemies, as well as rules on how to make Earthbound)<br /> &gt;Appendix<br /> Merits &amp; Flaws: Exactly what you think.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>loomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1027383-demon-the-fallen-board?p=1028065#post1028065\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They wouldn't actually have to wait to update Mummy, as it had its first edition in 1992. In fact, if they did a rush job they could declare it a 25th Anniversary edition and release it this year!</div> </div> </div> </div>Mummy20 would be rather easy because of the limited backlog of materials and there aren't enough critical fans of it to require serious deliberation to make the best product possible.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12085-beriorn","name":"Beriorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12085_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}